        "description": "The capital, with a bustling central market, a waterfront Caudan area and Chinatown.",
        "details": "Port Louis has a busy Central Market for spices, fabrics and street snacks such as dholl puri. The Caudan Waterfront has shops and cafes, and the Blue Penny Museum holds the rare stamps. The Aapravasi Ghat is a UNESCO site. Visit in the morning, and avoid Sundays when stalls close.",
